WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.007 --> 00:00:13.505
"Good morning," Ms. Fender said.

2
00:00:13.506 --> 00:00:27.355
"It's time for the talent show!"

3
00:00:27.355 --> 00:00:33.124
Dipper spun around in circles.

4
00:00:33.124 --> 00:00:46.246
Her music filled the air.

5
00:00:46.246 --> 00:00:49.429
Zippy zoomed across the parking lot.

6
00:00:49.429 --> 00:00:58.381
"Watch me!" he said.

7
00:00:58.381 --> 00:01:10.085
Gasser drove over dirt piles.

8
00:01:10.085 --> 00:01:16.536
Poppy told jokes.

9
00:01:16.536 --> 00:01:23.003
She did balloon tricks.

10
00:01:23.003 --> 00:01:25.477
Jeb looked at Eddy.

11
00:01:25.478 --> 00:01:34.067
"It's our turn now," Jeb said.

12
00:01:34.067 --> 00:01:37.787
Jeb lifted a big rock.

13
00:01:37.787 --> 00:01:40.550
He tossed it through the air. Everyone

14
00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:45.238
gasped. Eddy

15
00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:49.390
spun around and— Bang!

16
00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:53.011
The rock landed in Eddy's dumper.

17
00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:55.568
"Got it!" Eddy said.

18
00:01:55.569 --> 00:02:00.177
"Yay!" everyone cheered.

19
00:02:00.177 --> 00:02:04.211
Jeb tossed another rock.

20
00:02:04.211 --> 00:02:06.560
Eddy moved fast.

21
00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:07.818
Crunch!

22
00:02:07.819 --> 00:02:09.848
He caught the rock.

23
00:02:09.848 --> 00:02:15.399
The rock landed on the first rock!

24
00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:26.206
Jeb threw more rocks.

25
00:02:26.206 --> 00:02:29.893
Soon Eddy balanced six rocks.

26
00:02:29.894 --> 00:02:39.654
Everyone cheered.

27
00:02:39.655 --> 00:02:50.290
Eddy and Jeb grinned.

